  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\nStatement I:\n\n(1)/(2) + (1)/(6) + (1)/(12) + ...... (1)/(110) \n\nExpand LHS\n\n(1)/(2) + (1)/(2times 3) + (1)/(3times 4) + ...... (1)/(10times 11) \n\n(1)/(2) + (1)/(2) -(1)/(3) + (1)/(3) -(1)/(4) + ...... (1)/(10)-(1)/(11) \n\n1-(1)/(11) \n\n(10)/(11) \n\nwhich is wrong,\n\nStatement I is incorrect.\n\nStatement II:\n\n(1)/(3) + (1)/(15) + (1)/(35) + ...... (1)/(143) > (7)/(13) \n\n(1)/(3) + (1)/(3times 5) + (1)/(5times 7) + ...... (1)/(11times 13) > (7)/(13) \n\n(1)/(3) +(2)/(2)[ (1)/(3times 5) + (1)/(5times 7) + ...... (1)/(11times 13)] > (7)/(13) \n\n(1)/(3) +(1)/(2)[(1)/(3)-(1)/(5) + (1)/(5)-(1)/(7) + ...... +(1)/(11)-(1)/(13)] > (7)/(13) \n\n(1)/(3) +(1)/(2)[(1)/(3)-(1)/(13)] > (7)/(13) \n\n(1)/(3) +(5)/(39)> (7)/(13) \n\n(6)/(13)> (7)/(13) \n\nwhich is wrong\n\nStatement II is incorrect\n\nBoth the statement is incorrect.\n\n**∴ Option 4 is the correct answer.**",
